# --- bht-sjednica-final-review: keep the work product, not the source material ---
# The repo was deliberately reduced from ~100 MB to ~3.6 MB (see CLAUDE.md).
# These are third-party or regenerable inputs held locally; they are NOT committed.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no trailing-comment syntax - a comment after a pattern on the
# same line becomes part of the pattern and silently matches nothing.

